From a3794eeabfc9e9ed5e9ad89b932350aad7a5c3e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wolfram Huesken <woh@m18.io>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:15:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] docs(agent): bootstrap blobs before testing on a fresh
 clone

Rehearsing the patch bundle in a clean worktree at 82a92a92 showed the guide's
post-rebase steps were ordered wrong: make test-unit compiles the deposar embed
and fails because internal/resources/deparos/jstangle/*.pin+.zst are gitignored
and generated by make deps. make build first (it bootstraps them), then tests.
---
 docs/development/local-agent-pipeline-patches.md | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/docs/development/local-agent-pipeline-patches.md b/docs/development/local-agent-pipeline-patches.md
index d878249a..91125ee5 100644
--- a/docs/development/local-agent-pipeline-patches.md
+++ b/docs/development/local-agent-pipeline-patches.md
@@ -353,10 +353,14 @@ Conflict hotspots (rebasing: expect these, they are the ones that touch hot code
 After the rebase:
 
 ```bash
+make build                           # FIRST. Bootstraps the generated blobs:
+                                     #   internal/resources/deparos/jstangle/*.pin+.zst
+                                     #   are gitignored and produced by `make deps`,
+                                     #   so a bare `go build ./...` on a fresh clone
+                                     #   fails on the embed directive.
 make test-unit                       # repo suite
 go test ./pkg/olium/autopilot/ ./pkg/agent/ ./pkg/database/ ./internal/config/ ./pkg/cli/ -count=1
 ./vigolium-tuning.sh                 # config-side settings (run from the scan dir)
-make build                           # never build to an ad-hoc path: version injection
 vigolium config ls olium | grep stall_turns   # patch 6 present?
 ```
 
